# The old man is real, but the walkthroughs undersell the ritual.
# His arrival is a fresh roll on every entry to this room, and
# under this seed the fourth re-entry wins it. (Probed directly:
# the object tree shows him materialize in this room on that
# entry and stay.) Two details no walkthrough mentions: he is an
# "old and wizened man" huddled asleep in the corner, snoring,
# while the elvish sword blazes in his presence -- some old man!
# -- and bread offered to a sleeping man bounces off with "He is
# asleep!" Wake him first. Fed, he points at the engraved north
# wall -- "Perhaps what you seek is through there!" -- where the
# outline of a secret door appears, and he is gone between
# glances.

